The risk of thrombosis in patients with acute leukemia: occurrence of thrombosis at diagnosis and during treatment</article-title><source>J Thromb Haemost</source><year>2005</year><volume>3</volume><fpage>1985</fpage><lpage>1992</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Thromb Haemost||3|1985||bib6|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16102104</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Harris</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Jaffe</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Diebold</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Flandrin</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Mueller-Hermelinck</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Vardiman</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Lister</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Bloomfield</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>WHO classification of neoplastic diseases of the haematopoietic and lymphoid tissues: report of the clinical advisory committee meeting</article-title><source>J Clin Oncol</source><year>1999</year><volume>17</volume><fpage>3835</fpage><lpage>3849</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Clin Oncol||17|3835||bib7|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10577857</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lee</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Levine</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Venous thromboembolism and cancer: risks and outcome</article-title><source>Circulation</source><year>2003</year><volume>107</volume><fpage>I17</fpage><lpage>I21</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Circulation||107|I17||bib8|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12814981</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-gr